WEBVTT

09:00.441 --> 09:03.027
- Well fought!
- Piss off.

09:03.903 --> 09:05.238
(SPITS)

09:07.031 --> 09:10.827
- Did he hurt you?
- I've had worse.

09:12.036 --> 09:14.914
You can call me Sam...
if you want.

09:15.790 --> 09:19.043
- My mother calls me Sam.
- It's not going to get any easier, you know?

09:19.168 --> 09:22.755
- You're going to have to defend yourself.
- Why didn't you get up and fight?

09:23.756 --> 09:26.134
I wanted to.

09:26.259 --> 09:29.011
- I just couldn't.
- Why not?
